/ Failure — compare %dict% > %number% (order, non-coercible cross-type) → boundary maps Incomparable → PLang error.
Start
- set %d% = '{"a": 1}', type=json
- set %n% = 5
- set %caught% = ""
- compare %d% > %n%, on error call Caught
- assert %caught% equals "EvaluationError"

Caught
- set %caught% = %!error.Key%
